<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>使用 LogosCowork 构建个人知识库 · 使用报告 02</title>
<style>
:root{
  --paper:#F8F7F1;
  --paper-2:#F3F1E8;
  --card:#FFFDFA;
  --ink:#1B1A17;
  --ink-2:#54514A;
  --ink-3:#8E887B;
  --line:#E6E1D4;
  --brand:#D97757;
  --brand-deep:#B65C3D;
  --brand-soft:#FAF0EA;
  --brand-line:#EFCDBD;
  --radius:18px;
  --ease:cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);
  --shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(27,26,23,.04), 0 10px 26px rgba(27,26,23,.05);
  --shadow-lg:0 2px 6px rgba(27,26,23,.05), 0 26px 60px rgba(27,26,23,.10);
  --serif:"Songti SC","STSong","SimSun",Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{
  margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);
  font-family:"PingFang SC","Hiragino Sans GB","Microsoft YaHei",system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  background-image:
    linear-gradient(rgba(27,26,23,.028) 1px,transparent 1px),
    linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(27,26,23,.028) 1px,transparent 1px);
  background-size:88px 88px;
}
img{max-width:100%;display:block}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}

/* —— 顶部条 —— */
.topbar{
  position:sticky;top:0;z-index:60;
  backdrop-filter:blur(14px);background:rgba(248,247,241,.82);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
}
.topbar__in{
  max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:15px 40px;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;
}
.brandline{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--ink-3);font-weight:600}
.brandline i{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--brand);display:block;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(217,119,87,.14)}
.topbar__tag{
  font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--brand-deep);background:var(--brand-soft);
  border:1px solid var(--brand-line);border-radius:999px;padding:5px 13px;font-weight:600;
}
.progress{position:absolute;left:0;bottom:-1px;height:2px;width:0;background:var(--brand);transition:width .12s linear}

.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px}

/* —— 入场 —— */
.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px);transition:opacity .85s var(--ease),transform .85s var(--ease)}
.reveal.in{opacity:1;transform:none}
.reveal.d1{transition-delay:.08s}.reveal.d2{transition-delay:.16s}
.reveal.d3{transition-delay:.24s}.reveal.d4{transition-delay:.32s}

/* —— 首屏 —— */
.hero{padding:86px 0 64px;position:relative}
.hero__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.12fr .88fr;gap:56px;align-items:center}
.eyebrow{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.16em;
  color:var(--ink-3);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:26px;
}
.eyebrow b{color:var(--brand);font-weight:700}
h1{
  font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:700;font-size:56px;line-height:1.14;
  letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:0 0 22px;
}
h1 .hl{
  color:var(--brand);white-space:nowrap;
  background-image:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent 64%,rgba(217,119,87,.17) 64%);
}
.lede{font-size:17px;line-height:1.85;color:var(--ink-2);margin:0;max-width:36em}
.lede b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
.hero__meta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:30px}
.chip{
  font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-2);border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--card);
  border-radius:999px;padding:7px 14px;font-weight:500;
}

/* —— 轨道动效 —— */
.orbit{position:relative;height:340px;display:grid;place-items:center}
.orbit__stage{position:relative;width:330px;height:330px}
.orbit__ring{
  position:absolute;inset:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:50%;
}
.orbit__ring.r2{inset:46px;border-style:dashed;border-color:#DED8C8}
.orbit__ring.r3{inset:92px;border-color:var(--brand-line)}
.orbit__spin{position:absolute;inset:0;animation:spin 22s linear infinite}
.orbit__spin.rev{animation:spin 16s linear infinite reverse}
.orbit__dot{
  position:absolute;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--brand);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 5px rgba(217,119,87,.13);
}
.orbit__dot.s{width:7px;height:7px;background:var(--ink-3);box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(142,136,123,.12)}
.orbit__core{
  position:absolute;width:104px;height:104px;border-radius:50%;
  background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--brand-line);
  display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center;
  box-shadow:0 18px 40px rgba(217,119,87,.16);
}
.orbit__core span{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--brand-deep);line-height:1.35}
.orbit__glow{
  position:absolute;width:230px;height:230px;border-radius:50%;
  background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(217,119,87,.14),rgba(217,119,87,0) 68%);
  animation:breathe 6s ease-in-out infinite;
}
@keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}
@keyframes breathe{0%,100%{transform:scale(1);opacity:.85}50%{transform:scale(1.12);opacity:1}}

/* —— 通用小节 —— */
.sec{padding:58px 0}
.sec__head{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;margin-bottom:30px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.sec__no{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--brand);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:10px}
.sec h2{
  font-family:var(--serif);font-size:33px;line-height:1.3;margin:0;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.01em;
}
.sec__sub{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ink-3);margin:8px 0 0;line-height:1.7;max-width:34em}

/* —— 问题带 —— */
.quote-band{
  border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(250,240,234,.55),rgba(250,240,234,.15));
  padding:34px 40px;
}
.quote-band__in{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:76px 1fr;gap:26px;align-items:center}
.quote-band__mk{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:62px;line-height:.7;color:var(--brand);opacity:.5}
.quote-band p{margin:0;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:21px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ink)}
.quote-band p b{color:var(--brand-deep);font-weight:700}

/* —— 卡片 —— */
.card{
  background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);transition:transform .5s var(--ease),box-shadow .5s var(--ease),border-color .5s var(--ease);
}
.card--lift:hover{transform:translateY(-7px);box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);border-color:var(--brand-line)}

.two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:26px}
.act{padding:34px 32px 30px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.act::after{
  content:"";position:absolute;right:-40px;top:-40px;width:140px;height:140px;border-radius:50%;
  background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(217,119,87,.10),rgba(217,119,87,0) 70%);
  transition:transform .6s var(--ease);
}
.act:hover::after{transform:scale(1.35)}
.act__top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:22px}
.act__no{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--brand);font-weight:700}
.act h3{font-size:21px;margin:0 0 12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.act p.desc{font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.85;color:var(--ink-2);margin:0 0 20px}
.act ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:grid;gap:11px}
.act li{position:relative;padding-left:20px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink-2)}
.act li::before{
  content:"";position:absolute;left:2px;top:8px;width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;
  background:var(--brand);opacity:.55;
}
.act li b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}

/* 图标 */
.ico{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--brand-soft);border:1px solid var(--brand-line);display:grid;place-items:center}
.ico svg{width:21px;height:21px;stroke:var(--brand-deep);fill:none;stroke-width:1.6;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
.spin-slow{animation:spin 9s linear infinite;transform-origin:center}
.pulse-dot{animation:pulseDot 2.4s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes pulseDot{0%,100%{opacity:.35;r:2.2}50%{opacity:1;r:3.4}}

/* —— 流水线 —— */
.pipe-card{padding:34px 30px 30px;overflow:hidden}
.pipe{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);gap:12px;position:relative}
.step{
  position:relative;padding:20px 14px 18px;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid var(--line);
  background:#fff;transition:transform .45s var(--ease),background .45s var(--ease),border-color .45s var(--ease),box-shadow .45s var(--ease);
}
.step__n{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--ink-3);margin-bottom:12px}
.step__ic{width:30px;height:30px;margin-bottom:12px;display:grid;place-items:center}
.step__ic svg{width:24px;height:24px;stroke:var(--ink-2);fill:none;stroke-width:1.5;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;transition:stroke .4s var(--ease)}
.step h4{font-size:14.5px;margin:0 0 7px;font-weight:700}
.step p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--ink-3);margin:0}
.step.on{background:var(--brand-soft);border-color:var(--brand);transform:translateY(-5px);box-shadow:0 12px 26px rgba(217,119,87,.13)}
.step.on .step__ic svg{stroke:var(--brand-deep)}
.step.on h4{color:var(--brand-deep)}
.step.on p{color:#8A6A5D}
.pipe__foot{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:24px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-3);line-height:1.7}
.pipe__foot i{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--brand);flex:0 0 auto}

/* —— 截图 —— */
.shot{padding:0;overflow:hidden;border-radius:var(--radius)}
.shot__bar{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:13px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  background:var(--paper-2);
}
.shot__bar span{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#D9D3C4}
.shot__bar span:first-child{background:#E2C4B6}
.shot__bar em{margin-left:8px;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.04em}
.shot img{width:100%;display:block}
.shot__cap{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;padding:20px 24px}
.shot__cap p{margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ink-2);max-width:62em}
.shot__cap p b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
.badge{
  flex:0 0 auto;font-size:11.5px;color:#3E7A55;background:#EDF6F0;border:1px solid #CFE5D8;
  border-radius:999px;padding:5px 11px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;
}

/* —— 复盘 + 飞轮 —— */
.split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.02fr .98fr;gap:26px;align-items:stretch}
.plain{padding:32px 30px}
.plain h3{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 6px;font-weight:700}
.plain .sub{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-3);margin:0 0 24px;line-height:1.7}
.cron{display:grid;gap:12px}
.cron__row{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:118px 1fr;gap:16px;align-items:center;
  padding:15px 16px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:#fff;
  transition:border-color .4s var(--ease),background .4s var(--ease);
}
.cron__row:hover{border-color:var(--brand-line);background:#FFFCF8}
.cron__t{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--brand-deep);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.02em}
.cron__t svg{width:15px;height:15px;stroke:var(--brand);fill:none;stroke-width:1.6;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
.cron__d{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.65}
.cron__d b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
.cron__note{margin-top:18px;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ink-3);padding-left:2px}

.wheelcard{padding:30px 28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.wheel{position:relative;height:236px;display:grid;place-items:center;margin:2px 0 6px}
.wheel__ring{
  position:absolute;width:196px;height:196px;border-radius:50%;
  border:1px dashed #DCD5C3;
}
.wheel__sweep{
  position:absolute;width:196px;height:196px;border-radius:50%;
  background:conic-gradient(from 0deg,rgba(217,119,87,.22),rgba(217,119,87,0) 38%,rgba(217,119,87,0));
  animation:spin 7s linear infinite;
  -webkit-mask:radial-gradient(circle,transparent 44%,#000 45%);
          mask:radial-gradient(circle,transparent 44%,#000 45%);
}
.wheel__core{
  position:relative;width:96px;height:96px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--card);
  border:1px solid var(--brand-line);display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center;
  font-family:var(--serif);font-size:14px;line-height:1.35;color:var(--brand-deep);
  box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(217,119,87,.14);
}
.wheel__node{
  position:absolute;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-2);
  background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:6px 12px;
  box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(27,26,23,.05);white-space:nowrap;
}
.wheel__node.n1{top:6px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%)}
.wheel__node.n2{right:-6px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%)}
.wheel__node.n3{bottom:6px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%)}
.wheel__node.n4{left:-6px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%)}
.wheel-list{list-style:none;margin:auto 0 0;padding:14px 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);display:grid;gap:9px}
.wheel-list li{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.65;padding-left:16px;position:relative}
.wheel-list li::before{content:"→";position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--brand);font-size:11px;top:2px}

/* —— 价值 —— */
.g4{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px}
.val{padding:26px 22px}
.val__ic{width:32px;height:32px;margin-bottom:16px}
.val__ic svg{width:26px;height:26px;stroke:var(--brand);fill:none;stroke-width:1.5;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
.val h4{font-size:15px;margin:0 0 8px;font-weight:700}
.val p{font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ink-3);margin:0}

/* —— 链接 —— */
.links{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}
.link{
  padding:24px 22px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;
  background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;transition:all .45s var(--ease);
}
.link:hover{border-color:var(--brand);background:#FFFCF8;transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
.link__t{font-size:14.5px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 5px}
.link__d{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-3);margin:0;line-height:1.6}
.link__ar{width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--brand-soft);display:grid;place-items:center;flex:0 0 auto;transition:transform .45s var(--ease)}
.link:hover .link__ar{transform:translate(2px,-2px)}
.link__ar svg{width:14px;height:14px;stroke:var(--brand-deep);fill:none;stroke-width:1.8;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}

/* —— 结尾 —— */
.end{padding:70px 0 86px;text-align:center}
.end__rule{width:56px;height:1px;background:var(--brand);margin:0 auto 34px;opacity:.6}
.end blockquote{
  margin:0 auto;max-width:20em;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:32px;line-height:1.55;
  font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.01em;
}
.end blockquote em{font-style:normal;color:var(--brand)}
.end p{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-3);margin:26px 0 0;line-height:1.8}
.end .sig{margin-top:38px;font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:#B3AC9C}

.foot{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:22px 0 30px}
.foot__in{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;font-size:11.5px;color:#B3AC9C;letter-spacing:.06em}

@media (max-width:1080px){
  .hero__grid,.two,.split{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .g4{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .links{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .pipe{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr}
  .orbit{height:300px;order:-1}
  h1{font-size:42px}
  .sec h2{font-size:27px}
}
@media (max-width:640px){
  .wrap,.topbar__in,.foot__in,.quote-band__in{padding-left:22px;padding-right:22px}
  .pipe,.g4{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .quote-band__in{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .quote-band__mk{display:none}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  *{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}
  .reveal{opacity:1;transform:none}
}
@media print{
  .topbar{position:static}
  .progress{display:none}
  body{background:#fff;background-image:none}
  .reveal{opacity:1!important;transform:none!important}
  .sec{padding:22px 0}
  .card,.pipe-card,.act,.val,.wheelcard,.shot{break-inside:avoid}
  .card--lift:hover{transform:none;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
}
</style>
<noscript><style>.reveal{opacity:1;transform:none}.step{background:var(--brand-soft);border-color:var(--brand)}</style></noscript>
</head>
<body>

<div class="topbar">
  <div class="topbar__in">
    <div class="brandline"><i></i>LOGOSCOWORK 使用报告</div>
    <div class="topbar__tag">02 · 个人知识库</div>
  </div>
  <div class="progress" id="progress"></div>
</div>

<!-- ============ 首屏 ============ -->
<header class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero__grid">
      <div class="reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow"><b>二</b> · 使用场景 · 知识资产化</div>
        <h1>使用 LogosCowork<br>构建<span class="hl">个人知识库</span></h1>
        <p class="lede">
          项目成果、调研资料、复盘结论，全部落在一个本地库里；
          归档、命名、补索引由 agent 按固定规则完成；
          每次复盘再把这套流程里重复的部分，沉淀成可复用的 skill。
        </p>
        <div class="hero__meta">
          <span class="chip">本地笔记库 · Obsidian</span>
          <span class="chip">本地文件夹绑定</span>
          <span class="chip">para-wiki-librarian skill</span>
          <span class="chip">周期复盘 → 复用</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="orbit reveal d2" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="orbit__glow"></div>
        <div class="orbit__stage">
          <div class="orbit__ring"></div>
          <div class="orbit__ring r2"></div>
          <div class="orbit__ring r3"></div>
          <div class="orbit__spin">
            <span class="orbit__dot" style="top:-4px;left:calc(50% - 4px)"></span>
            <span class="orbit__dot s" style="bottom:38px;right:52px"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="orbit__spin rev">
            <span class="orbit__dot" style="bottom:-4px;left:calc(50% - 4px)"></span>
            <span class="orbit__dot s" style="top:44px;left:48px"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="orbit__core"><span>个人<br>知识库</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ============ 起点 ============ -->
<section class="quote-band">
  <div class="quote-band__in">
    <div class="quote-band__mk">&ldquo;</div>
    <p>
      项目做完就散了：成果在某个文件夹，调研在某个收藏夹，判断只留在脑子里。<br>
      下一个同类项目来的时候，<b>一切从头再来一遍</b>。
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ 动作 ============ -->
<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec__head reveal">
      <div>
        <div class="sec__no">01 / 两个动作</div>
        <h2>先有一个库，再让 agent 接管归档</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="sec__sub">一个人做两件事：把资料放到该放的地方，把"放"这件事交给规则。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="two">
      <article class="card card--lift act reveal d1">
        <div class="act__top">
          <span class="act__no">01</span>
          <span class="ico">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 5.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 5.5 4H10l2 2.5h6.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 20 8v10a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5 1.5h-13A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 4 18Z"/><path d="M8 12h8M8 15.5h5"/></svg>
          </span>
        </div>
        <h3>建一个自己的本地库</h3>
